{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord","id":1381526,"title":"Making a Warstrider That is a Demon Lord","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-14T22:06:23-07:00","id":1381526,"title":"Making a Warstrider That is a Demon Lord","content":"Over on the Exalted: Essence threat, I proposed a Hellstrider (though I was convinced to turn it into a Malfeas-themed normal warstrider, because warstriders don't need a special category to be unique) that is also a major character in its - or rather, her - own right, born when a mortal woman who sacrificed herself to the Forge of Night to become the core intellect of the living chassis of a weapon meant to protect her relatives. She now not only is a great warstrider in her own right, she's the lord of an entire fiefdom, constantly seeking new viceroy-pilots to bring forth her Evocations and maintain order in her Protectorate of the Steel Fiend. I'm calling her Angibode, the Palaquin Who Is Queen.<br /> <br /> I've decided to create this threat for brainstorming what she is in game terms. She obviously has Intimacies like a certain Devil Tower, but I say she likely has a few skills, and has the ability to attune to a mortal (especially a demon-blood) who is willingly adopted by her as an heir to the throne, which given how she <i>is </i>the throne means her new pilot becomes fanatically loyal to her and replaces most of their Intimacies with her own. A creature with a Limit track has more free will, but she can fight back against orders she doesn't want. She is, however, very kind and motherly by nature, so she can be talked into leaving her domain behind for a bit to defend an heir's living relatives and culture, and sometimes may actually care more than her pilot does if they're a mortal. I say that, to fit with her &quot;general&quot; theming, at least one of her Evocations allows her to deploy autonomous golem-drones as a ground or sky force; she's meant to lead, not just crush.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T22:32:54-07:00","id":1381530,"title":"","content":"Huh, interesting. How much dots are you considering for her. 5? Or N/A? I'm guessing later like Kavara?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T22:48:46-07:00","id":1381534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord?p=1381530#post1381530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh, interesting. How much dots are you considering for her. 5? Or N/A? I'm guessing later like Kavara?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm thinking 5, if only so she can be part of a starting character's Merits and making her an important part of the chronicle from session 1 in games about infernal politics. N/A would fit, though, especially given how close she is to Kavara.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T06:58:17-07:00","id":1381635,"title":"","content":"One Evocation should allow her to spend her Devastating Action as a reflexive Defend Other action, since her entire purpose is the defense of her family and fiefdom, and that of her pilot.<br /> <br /> If she used her regular action for Defend Other, then this Evocation (or a following one) would allow her to use her Devastating Action to reflexively counter-attack even if the target doesn't normally qualify as a valid target for a Devastating Action.<br /> <br /> <br /> Another Evocation should facilitate travel between her fiefdom in Malfeas and the pilot's home in Creation, but still respecting the Five Days Travel law. This might involve turning the entire mortal society to demon-worship, to make the place reflect Malfeas as much as possible. Eventually the entire society might be devoured into Malfeas, adding itself to the warstrider's fiefdom.<br /> <br /> <br /> Simply allowing a mortal to attune to her doesn't negate the need for a Hearthstone, so that's something to consider. Though a mortal ruler could control a manse or wildstone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T09:10:11-07:00","id":1381662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord?p=1381534#post1381534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm thinking 5, if only so she can be part of a starting character's Merits and making her an important part of the chronicle from session 1 in games about infernal politics. N/A would fit, though, especially given how close she is to Kavara.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think it's a mistake to say that an Artifact NA can't be part of a character's starting equipment and be in the chronicle from session 1. It's simply a matter of the ST must permit those things to happen, because they want to tell a specific story. An Artifact NA will almost certainly dominate the chronicle, yes, but is there any real difference between that happening right from the start, and introducing it later? It's still the ST's decision either way, and in either case, while one character might wield the artifact (or in this case, pilot her), all the other PCs will also have to adapt their narratives to deal with this being/warstrider's impact.<br /> <br /> All of this is to say, I think that this should definitely be Artifact NA, based on the description you've got so far. If her power level is anywhere near Kavara, she pretty much has to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T09:50:40-07:00","id":1381669,"title":"","content":"Yeah I\u2019d say deploying a BG of golem children is NA level stuff. I don\u2019t think we have a comparable Battle Group Generating artifact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T10:04:38-07:00","id":1381677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord?p=1381669#post1381669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah I\u2019d say deploying a BG of golem children is NA level stuff. I don\u2019t think we have a comparable Battle Group Generating artifact.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends how strong the golems are. I mean, Summer Thunder can deploy a battle group and that's Artifact 3 (although it's also a once-per-scene apex Evocation, so perhaps hard to compare).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T10:17:19-07:00","id":1381687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord?p=1381677#post1381677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depends how strong the golems are. I mean, Summer Thunder can deploy a battle group and that's Artifact 3 (although it's also a once-per-scene apex Evocation, so perhaps hard to compare).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, that's going to be a big question for limitations. <br /> <br /> Though before I go (have to transport this computer around for online classes), I am wondering if Intimacy Replacement isn't all she does to her mortal pilots; I remembered the Faced Mechon from Xenoblade Chronicles when working, and it's quite thematic if a mortal pilot who renounces their selfhood also renounces (part of) their humanity and is remade into a cyborg; when a bound pilot talks, at least part of Angibode is speaking through them (and it allows her to make a pilot properly able to pilot her - who knows, it might be a Sorcerous Initiation for some of the less physically adept pilots).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T10:31:00-07:00","id":1381692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord#post1381526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I say that, to fit with her &quot;general&quot; theming, at least one of her Evocations allows her to deploy autonomous golem-drones as a ground or sky force; she's meant to lead, not just crush.</div> </div> </div> </div>I missed this part.<br /> <br /> In addition to my other suggestion, she would have the ability to spend her Devastating Actions as reflexive Command Actions for any minions she spawns.<br /> <br /> This might have a synergistic bonus with the Evocation I suggested, regarding spending her Devastating Action for reflexive Defend Others, when she is commanding her minions to Defend Other in her stead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T10:41:17-07:00","id":1381697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1381526-making-a-warstrider-that-is-a-demon-lord?p=1381677#post1381677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Depends how strong the golems are. I mean, Summer Thunder can deploy a battle group and that's Artifact 3 (although it's also a once-per-scene apex Evocation, so perhaps hard to compare).</div> </div> </div> </div>Marching Fever Dream Nightmare (a charm of the Fair Folk Cataphract) and as you mentioned Summer Thunder's Phantom Cavalry Cavalcade are good precidents for creating expendible hard light minions. It might be possible to wring more power out of an evocation by making it so that the golem children need to be repaired before you can use the charm again.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}